    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "SPACIOUS FOUR-BEDROOM FAMILY HOME WITH CONSERVATORY & GENEROUS REAR GARDEN\n\nSmith Property Bailieborough proudly presents No. 43 Twin Oaks, a spacious four-bedroom semi-detached home situated within this established and popular residential development on the edge of Bailieborough town.\n\nThis well-proportioned property offers excellent accommodation throughout and provides an ideal opportunity for families seeking a comfortable home within easy reach of the town centre and a wide range of local amenities.\n\nExtending to approximately 118 sq. m / 1270sq ft, the property offers generous living space across two floors, with four bedrooms, including a principal bedroom with ensuite, a main family bathroom and a convenient downstairs WC.\n\nThe ground floor is particularly well suited to family living, with a welcoming sitting room, spacious kitchen and dining area, and the added benefit of a conservatory extending from the kitchen and dining room. The conservatory provides an additional versatile living space and features double doors opening directly onto the rear patio and garden, creating a natural connection between the indoor and outdoor areas. The sitting room also benefits from an open fireplace, adding a traditional focal point and a sense of warmth to the room.\n\nThe kitchen and dining area provide excellent space for everyday family life, while the conservatory offers further room for dining, relaxing or entertaining.\n\nUpstairs, there are four well-proportioned bedrooms, with the principal bedroom benefiting from its own ensuite shower room. A main family bathroom completes the first-floor accommodation.\n\nExternally, No. 43 benefits from a particularly spacious rear garden, offering excellent potential for families, children and outdoor entertaining. The patio area immediately adjoining the conservatory provides an ideal setting for outdoor dining, while the generous garden beyond offers plenty of space for recreation, gardening or simply enjoying the outdoors.\n\nThe property is heated by oil-fired central heating and has a C-rated BER, offering a good balance of comfort and energy efficiency.\n\nThe location is a major attraction, with Twin Oaks situated within convenient reach of Bailieborough town centre and its extensive range of shopping, leisure and everyday amenities. Supermarkets including Tesco and Super Value are readily accessible, while the town also provides cafés, independent shops, schools, healthcare services and sporting facilities.\n\nFor those seeking leisure and recreation, the property is within easy reach of local amenities and facilities, while the surrounding area provides access to a range of outdoor pursuits. The location also provides convenient access to Kingscourt, Virginia, Cavan and surrounding areas, making it a practical base for both local and commuter living.\n\nWith its generous four-bedroom accommodation, ensuite, downstairs WC, conservatory, spacious rear garden and convenient location, No. 43 Twin Oaks represents an excellent opportunity to acquire a substantial family home in a well-established residential setting.\n\nWhether you are looking to purchase your first family home, require additional bedroom and living space, or are looking for a property with excellent potential in a convenient town location, this property is well worth consideration.\n\n\n"
      },
